+## v8 add-on: normalization execution safety
+
+- Added `scripts/plan-normalization-execution.py` to generate deterministic JSON execution plans from `xenia.normalization.toml` and the live tree.
+- Added `scripts/apply-normalization-execution.py`, a dry-run-first executor that never overwrites targets and writes an execution ledger plus rollback script when `--apply` is used.
+- Added `scripts/check-post-normalization.py` to verify app/library placement, active artifact cleanup, and Cargo workspace-member updates after normalization.
+- Extended `xenia.normalization.toml` with execution metadata and postconditions.
+- Added `docs/runbooks/NORMALIZATION_EXECUTION_PROTOCOL.md`, `docs/release/NORMALIZATION_EXECUTION_ACCEPTANCE.md`, and `docs/agents/NORMALIZATION_AGENT_RULES.md`.
+- Updated validation, preflight, handoff, and release-train files to include normalization execution evidence and post-move checks.
